# tools/nativegen/.gitignore
#
# Only the generator's own source is versioned. Everything else is either
#   - the GENERATED GAME CODE in out/ (derived from Nintendo's copyrighted game code -
#     must NEVER be committed), or
#   - machine-specific build artifacts (WASM/JS/object files, logs, scratch files).
*
!*.h
!*.cpp
!.gitignore
